      {
        "step": "E1",
        "wait_business_days": 0,
        "is_reply": false,
        "subject": "{first_name}: Airtable",
        "body_html": "<div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Hi {first_name},</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Noticed you recently signed up for Airtable. I'm on the account team and help support {account}, so I'm curious if you're joining an existing team or exploring a specific use case?</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Airtable brings together workflows like intake, planning, roadmaps, project management, and reporting in one place.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">If this sounds useful, I'd be happy to chat in the coming weeks about your team's needs or answer any Airtable questions.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Are you free for a call next week, {first_name}?</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Best,</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">{sender}</span></div>"
      },
      {
        "step": "E2",
        "wait_business_days": 3,
        "is_reply": true,
        "subject": "",
        "body_html": "<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Hi {first_name}, after sending you the note below, I realized you've probably been swamped the past week.&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">To confirm, would you be open to making brief introductions next week?</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">{sender}</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div>"
      },
