        "step": "E3",
        "wait_business_days": 6,
        "is_reply": false,
        "subject": "Checking in",
        "body_html": "<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Hi {first_name}, most people we speak with are excited to get started in Airtable, but they need some help building out their workflows in the platform.&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Here are some examples for inspiration:&nbsp;</span></div><div><ul style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; padding-left: 26px\"><li><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">How McKinsey&nbsp;</span><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.airtable.com/lp/resources/webinars/enabling-agile-marketing\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">implements agile workflows</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">&nbsp;and best practices for their clients</span></div></li><li><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">How Vimeo&nbsp;</span><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.airtable.com/customer-stories/vimeo?_gl=1*suxgpu*_ga*MTk4OTQwMDQ0MC4xNjc1MDk1MDY0*_ga_HF9VV0C1X2*MTcwNzE4MDExNy44LjEuMTcwNzE4MDk0Mi4zNS4wLjA.\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">replaced 7 siloed tools</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">&nbsp;with a single source of truth for their team's work</span></div></li><li><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Our all new&nbsp;</span><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.airtable.com/ai-plays\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">AI Playbook</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">&nbsp;to help team execute faster</span></div></li></ul><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Let me know if any of these use cases are relevant and I'm happy to set up a call to help you start setting up something similar for your team.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">{sender}</span></div>"
      },
      {
        "step": "E4",
        "wait_business_days": 9,
        "is_reply": false,
        "subject": "Airtable Templates",
        "body_html": "<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Hi {first_name},&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">I'll leave some&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.airtable.com/templates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">templates</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">&nbsp;here to help you get started, but if you or your teammates have any questions about Airtable, please don't hesitate to reach out.&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Enjoy.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">{sender}</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div>"
      }
    ],
