        "subject": "{account} and Airtable - Welcome to the new platform. ",
        "body_html": "<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Hi {first_name},&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Reaching out as I'm on the account team and help support {account}, and I also work with new teams exploring Airtable for their workflows to ensure everyone is set up for success.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">I noticed that you recently signed up and joined a new Airtable Workspace. Not sure if you're aware that {account} already has an Enterprise Airtable account with an MSA in place. Meaning your team can be added so you're not missing out on key features and improved collaboration. Happy to answer any questions around the workflow being brought into Airtable, the existing Airtable usage across {account}, or any questions around the existing Enterprise.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Would you like to set up a few minutes to chat next week?&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Best,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">{sender}</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div>"
      },
      {
        "step": "E2",
        "wait_business_days": 3,
        "is_reply": true,
        "subject": "",
        "body_html": "<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Hi {first_name},&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Wanted to send a brief follow up on my below note - we've been working with teams to tackle challenges like cross-functional data silos and lack of discoverability of crucial information.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Below is a brief depiction of some of the&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.airtable.com/solutions/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">many applications</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">&nbsp;for Airtable across a business:</span></div><div><a href=\"https://www.airtable.com/solutions/all\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/api/cloud_files/UDG5w6JOHnt2SpP9zWvj2lok8wiyp_lbnn0g2yIbeUA\" style=\"height: 282px; width: 510px\" height=\"282\" width=\"510\"></img></a><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Would you be interested in connecting to hear about best practices in these areas that might help your team?</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Best,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">{sender}</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div>"
      },
