        "subject": "",
        "body_html": "<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Hi {first_name}, after sending you the note below, I realized you've probably been swamped the past week.&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">To confirm, would you be open to making brief introductions next week?</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">{sender}</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div>"
      },
      {
        "step": "E4",
        "wait_business_days": 9,
        "is_reply": true,
        "subject": "",
        "body_html": "<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Hi {first_name},</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Everyone who comes to Airtable has a unique use case - it's the pro and the con of having such a flexible platform that can help so many people with different processes.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">That said, it can be challenging to onboard - my role is to help you efficiently onboard and navigate Airtable for the specific requirements you have in mind.&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Would you be interested in&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/j9bkoFAUpSbwwcZeA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">a quick conversation</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">&nbsp;about your process? Feel free to use that link to set up a time if so.&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Best,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">{sender}</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div>"
