        "body_html": "<div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Hi {first_name},</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">I noticed you recently signed up for Airtable. I’m on the account team and help support {company}, so I’m curious if you’re joining an existing team or exploring a specific use case?</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Not sure if you’re aware, but {company} already has an Enterprise account with Airtable. That means it would be easy for you and your team to join, giving you access to all the benefits and support your colleagues are already using.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">If this sounds useful, I’d be happy to connect in the coming weeks to discuss new use cases, current projects, our AI features, or to answer any Airtable questions.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Are you free for a call next week?</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">Best,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\">{sender}</span></div><div style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, Liberation Sans, Arial, sans serif; font-size: 13px\"><br /></div>"
